{"name": "Golden Self", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Descend Into Your Own Psyche</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Golden Self</i></strong> is a surreal action roguelike about confronting the fragments of who you are.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle inner demons, explore shifting dreamscapes, and uncover the truth waiting at your Core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/cc77b886f541c4328a473f77add3ecd5.poster.avif?t=1780489914\" width=\"608\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/cc77b886f541c4328a473f77add3ecd5.webm?t=1780489914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/cc77b886f541c4328a473f77add3ecd5.mp4?t=1780489914\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast, responsive combat where every strike matters.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chain dodges, abilities, and weapon forms to survive the ever-changing trials of your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"320\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/bb394d0f7ec11551eeaa06e7862d56e8.poster.avif?t=1780489914\" width=\"608\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/bb394d0f7ec11551eeaa06e7862d56e8.webm?t=1780489914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/bb394d0f7ec11551eeaa06e7862d56e8.mp4?t=1780489914\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore and Adapt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock powers that alter your playstyle with each run.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with builds, abilities, and relics as you grow stronger  or spiral deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"242\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/b557298a07ce524fdcabefcc5cb40fef.poster.avif?t=1780489914\" width=\"608\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/b557298a07ce524fdcabefcc5cb40fef.webm?t=1780489914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/b557298a07ce524fdcabefcc5cb40fef.mp4?t=1780489914\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Replay and Rebuild</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is another chance to understand yourself.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt, overcome, and descend again, drawing from a pool of over 440 items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/21f609805c49d1b84d4250361fb7c4f4.poster.avif?t=1780489914\" width=\"608\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/21f609805c49d1b84d4250361fb7c4f4.webm?t=1780489914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/21f609805c49d1b84d4250361fb7c4f4.mp4?t=1780489914\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unravel Your Inner Truth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the seven different endings, each revealing a different piece of the Golden Self.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/e723d63fafc9f42f59076c9f476254a5.poster.avif?t=1780489914\" width=\"608\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/e723d63fafc9f42f59076c9f476254a5.webm?t=1780489914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/e723d63fafc9f42f59076c9f476254a5.mp4?t=1780489914\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So what are you waiting for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/13e3afad09dc9f8f8c46d3f71af6ba33.poster.avif?t=1780489914\" width=\"608\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/13e3afad09dc9f8f8c46d3f71af6ba33.webm?t=1780489914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114430/extras/13e3afad09dc9f8f8c46d3f71af6ba33.mp4?t=1780489914\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Developed by Lightning Oath, a solo developer</i></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A fast paced action roguelike focused on precision combat and punishing boss fights. Embark on a mythic journey to discover your Golden Self.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co